  "msc-math-done" [label="PROJECT DONE\nmsc-math\nBLOCKED", shape=doubleoctagon, fillcolor="#fce9e5", color="#ba6251", tooltip="Project completion requires supported and readable selected thesis claims, truthful code/data/reproduction and availability promises, a frozen candidate meeting the recorded human PASS threshold, required delivery/archive dispositions, and released assignments. This map does not assert any present whole-project readiness.\nblocker: Workflow implementation/acceptance, thesis source/support/human PASS, code/evidence and reproduction checks, actual delivery/archive dispositions and final session release remain unfinished.\nplan_gap: The 4 October bounded run is selected. Human acceptance, university submission status and optional workflow activation remain unknown or outside this run.\nproject: msc-math\nauthorization: Jörn explicitly restarted from fe3475b3 on 4 October 2026: best supported thesis PDF/repository using remaining weekly quota (numeric balance unknown), no human questions, absolute stop 2026-10-04T02:00:00Z. No public release or university submission.\nnext_step: Checked restart candidate available; no restart work remains assigned. Future human/scope/reproduction/archive dispositions are separate from this completed bounded delivery.\nSources: docs/coordination/thesis-work.md, docs/coordination/handoff.md, docs/project-facts.md, ARCHITECTURE.md", penwidth=2, fontsize=14];
