  "thesis-scope-disposition" [label="Scope disposition\nBLOCKED", shape=hexagon, fillcolor="#fce9e5", color="#ba6251", tooltip="Clarify whether the closed named DS method table meets Jörn’s intended scope; explicitly select, omit or defer remaining optional results. Preserve required result areas and support-strength caveats; do not count ledger rows against the historical approximate repertoire size.\nblocker: Overall DS scope classification remains uncertain; restart preserves its named closed-table claims without inferring human scope acceptance.\nplan_gap: Fixed-pentagon/symmetric-partner selection is unresolved; optional research validity does not create a thesis obligation.\nproject: thesis\nauthorization: Completion criterion mapped. The oct04-candidate restart authorizes bounded thesis/repository improvement until 02:00 UTC; human PASS, public release and university submission are not implied.\nnext_step: Present exact current-source scope choices separately from reader concerns and optional research.\nSources: docs/coordination/thesis-work.md, docs/project-facts.md"];
